<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
	<head>
		<meta charset="UTF-8">
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
		<title>Confirmación de compra</title>
		<style>
			@media only screen and (max-width: 560px) {
				.email-shell { padding: 16px !important; }
				.card { width: 100% !important; }
				.header, .content, .footer { padding-left: 24px !important; padding-right: 24px !important; }
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f4f5f5; font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color:#1c2733;">
		<table class="email-shell" role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%; background-color:#f4f5f5; padding:40px 16px;">
			<tr>
				<td align="center">
					<table class="card" role="presentation" width="520" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:520px; background-color:#ffffff; border:1px solid #dfe3e6; border-radius:12px; overflow:hidden;">
						<tr>
							<td style="height:4px; background-color:#284b63; font-size:0; line-height:0;">&nbsp;</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td class="header" style="padding:24px 32px 21px; border-bottom:1px solid #e7e9eb;">
								<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
									<tr>
										<td style="vertical-align:middle;">
											<img src="{{ ticketplus_logo() }}" width="150" alt="Ticket+" style="display:block; width:150px; max-width:100%; height:auto; border:0;">
										</td>
										<td style="vertical-align:middle; text-align:right;">
											<span style="display:block; color:#526879; font-size:9px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:1.2px; text-transform:uppercase;">Compra confirmada</span>
											<span style="display:block; margin-top:3px; color:#1c2733; font-size:14px; font-weight:700;">Confirmación de compra</span>
										</td>
									</tr>
								</table>
							</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td class="content" style="padding:32px;">
								<p style="margin:0 0 7px; color:#526879; font-size:10px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:1.3px; text-transform:uppercase;">Compra confirmada</p>
								<h1 style="margin:0 0 15px; color:#17212b; font-size:24px; line-height:1.3; font-weight:700;">Hola, {{ name }}</h1>
								<p style="margin:0 0 20px; color:#59636b; font-size:14px; line-height:1.65;">
									Tu compra se ha procesado correctamente. En este correo encontrarás adjuntas las entradas correspondientes a tu compra en formato PDF.
								</p>
								<div style="padding:14px 16px; color:#59636b; background-color:#f6f6f4; border-left:3px solid #8a969f; border-radius:0 5px 5px 0; font-size:12px; line-height:1.55;">
									<strong style="color:#1c2733;">Importante</strong><br>
									Presenta tus entradas desde tu teléfono o impresas al momento de ingresar al evento.
								</div>
							</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td class="footer" style="padding:20px 32px 24px; color:#59636b; border-top:1px solid #e7e9eb; text-align:center; font-size:11px; line-height:1.5;">
								Ticket+ · Lo que vas a recordar empieza aquí.
							</td>
						</tr>
					</table>
				</td>
			</tr>
		</table>
	</body>
</html>
